sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over Product, CN: Scanning for peripherals using resolvable private addresses

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.StartDeviceDiscovery()
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(scanning)
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.DeviceDiscovered(<br>addressWithType={address=6C:8B:2F:3A:9D:41, addressType=randomAddress},<br>rssi=-42)

    Note over Product: Check if this RPA belongs to a known bonded device

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.ResolvePrivateAddress(6C:8B:2F:3A:9D:41)

    alt Device is bonded
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.ResolvePrivateAddressResult(<br>success=true, identityAddress=C4:AB:12:34:56:78)
        Note over Product: Known device, proceed with connection
    else Device is not bonded
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.ResolvePrivateAddressResult(<br>success=false)
        Note over Product: Unknown device
    end
